# Static output placeholder.
#
# This project is an API, not a website. Vercel still packages a static "output
# directory" for non-framework projects, and without this override it defaults
# to the repository root / `dist`, which published the compiled backend sources
# at /server.js, /config/env.js and so on. `vercel.json` points the output
# directory here instead, so the only static asset is this file.
#
# The API itself is served by the serverless functions in `../api/`, which are
# detected independently of this directory.
